    "narrative": {
      "summary": "末班车过后，林舟和顾宁发现一张写着明日期的信，起初他们以为有人能预见未来，随后调查发现这是一场浪漫的周年纪念惊喜。",
      "chapters": [
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-chapter-1",
          "title": "深夜车站",
          "summary": "信的出现让两人感到诡异，猜测其来源。",
          "documentIds": [
            "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-chapter-2",
          "title": "真相大白",
          "summary": "调查中发现信来自女友的提前寄送，正是纪念日礼物。",
          "documentIds": [
            "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "documents": [
    {
      "schemaVersion": "0.7",
      "documentId": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1",
      "title": "站台的意外",
      "summary": "两人独自走在寂静的站台上，捡到一封信。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-start",
          "type": "cue",
          "cue": {
            "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-bg",
            "type": "courtroom.background",
            "params": {
              "resource": {
                "packId": "official.courtroom-demo",
                "id": "background/night-corridor"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨晚的梦真奇妙，好像预言了什么。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "什么梦？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "信封上写着‘2025‑07‑23’，明天的日期。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "不可能吧？车站都没关人怎么可能有信？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "对啊，这像是在暗示什么，能不能查查是谁寄的？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-5",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我去问问值班员。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c1-s1-6",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "顺便看看有没有其他类似的信。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schemaVersion": "0.7",
      "documentId": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1",
      "title": "岁月的惊喜",
      "summary": "两人找到寄件人，原来是未见面的男友提前邮寄的周年礼物。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-start",
          "type": "cue",
          "cue": {
            "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-bg",
            "type": "courtroom.background",
            "params": {
              "resource": {
                "packId": "official.courtroom-demo",
                "id": "background/lake-dock"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "值班员说信是今天早上邮寄的，寄件人是‘S’。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "S？不会吧，难道……"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我翻了柜台后面的信件箱，发现一张贺卡，上面写着‘一周年快乐，我们提前送达。’"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "对！卡片上还有他签名的首字母‘S’和日期。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这么说，别人真的不能预见未来，这只是单纯的惊喜而已。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-5",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "原来如此，这里的每个人都期待已久的纪念日，竟然变成了地铁站的一场小意外。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-last-train-c2-s1-6",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "至少我们今晚少了疑虑，多了一份甜蜜。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
